Z||000025||FieroJoe||02-18-2001||10:24 PM||||Very unfortunate.  It really makes you realize what life is, once it is gone to someone who you may hold close to in your heart.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I just got done reading one of the reuter's news articles on this, and it said that Jeff Burton had almost predicted to the t that this was going to happen.  It is because of the opening up of the restrictor plate to allow for more horses, and more passing power, to make for a "better" race.  some race eh<P><BR>lotsa articles here.<BR> <A HREF="http://dailynews.yahoo.com/h/nm/20010218/sp/nascar_daytona_dc_13.html" TARGET=_blank>http://dailynews.yahoo.com/h/nm/20010218/sp/nascar_daytona_dc_13.html</A> <BR>||||reg||9
