Z||000048||2M4 Dale||02-21-2001||11:04 AM||||I think that any TRUE fans of NASCAR, or any form of motorsports,  know that Sterling Marlin was not responsible....IN ANY WAY....for Big E's death....that pisses me off and it's totally unfair.......Dale would kick anyones a$$ who said that it was Sterlings fault !!!<P>THATS RACIN !!!!!!!!!||||reg||8
